m `merge.protected_paths` (`.github/`, `.ard/config.yaml` and the `.ard/` role directories). `local.Options`, `local.LogBase` and `(*Local).WorktreePath` stay unchanged, but `executor` gains a public `EnvPolicy`. Concurrency: the sidecar lock map must move with its mutex, and `Local.mu` must still guard `tracks`. The unchanged `local` tests guard it.\n\n### Size\n\nL (about 1,300-1,400 changed lines, since a move counts twice under `--no-renames`). It stays under the 2,000-line warning only if `execGit` and the behaviour tests stay in `local`. Files touched:\n- `internal/executor/workspace/{fs,layout,populate,sidecar,workspace,prepare,remove}.go` (new)\n- `internal/executor/workspace/*_test.go` (new)\n- `internal/executor/envpolicy.go` and its test (new)\n- `internal/executor/local/{local,layout,sidecar,env,docker,proc_unix}.go`\n- `internal/executor/local/{local,sidecar,cleanup,misc}_test.go`\n- `docs/layout.md`\nMakefile\n4:.PHONY: build test lint fmt clean cve-fixtures lts-fixtures lint-scanner-fixtures chart-test image-test agent-image agent-image-test docs-check release-check\n12:lint:\n53:# Regenerates the real lint scanner fixtures in the pinned image (see\n54:# internal/roles/testdata/lint/regen.sh). Needs Docker; not part of `make test`.\n55:lint-scanner-fixtures:\n56:\tdocker build -t ard-lint-fixtures internal/roles/scanners/lint\n58:\t  -v \"$$PWD/internal/roles:/roles\" -w /roles ard-lint-fixtures sh testdata/lint/regen.sh","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JMHCocXgAaXLoDvt7KB7kj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
